Package: oddsapi
Type: Package
Title: R Client for the 'odds-api.net' Sports Odds API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Odds API", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "support@odds-api.net")
Description: Access sports, leagues, bookmakers, events, odds snapshots,
    line movement history, results and racing data from 'odds-api.net'
    <https://odds-api.net>. Provides authenticated requests, bounded retries,
    explicit cursor pagination and data frames for sports odds analysis.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
URL: https://odds-api.net, https://github.com/odds-api/odds-api,
    https://github.com/odds-api/odds-api/tree/main/sdks/r
BugReports: https://github.com/odds-api/odds-api/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: httr2 (>= 1.0.0)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.2.0), roxygen2
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
